%abc-2.1
% Melody, chords and words transcribed by hand from the writers' own lead sheet,
% sources/sheetPdf.pdf (songsofpraise.org/pdf/myheart.pdf), bar for bar. Bar numbers
% match the PDF. The piano left hand and the inner voices are not transcribed.
% Checked against the melody track of sources/tune.mid (tools/check-abc-midi.py).
% Where the two differ the PDF wins: the MIDI anticipates beat 2 by an eighth in the
% "here to love You" bars, and sings "Sur-" on B, where the PDF has D.
